@startuml
title GC2D HDF5 Guiding-Center Potential Architecture

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam wrapWidth 220

hide circle

class "1. Legacy HDF5 source" as HDF5Source {
  .. Root datasets ..
  Rcells: x coordinates
  Zcells: y coordinates
  freqs: temporal frequencies
  fields: complex [frequency, y, x]
  --
  Root attributes: source metadata
  Stored field orientation is preserved
}

class "2. Import pipeline\nload_gc2d_h5_potential(...)" as ImportPipeline {
  .. Validation ..
  B, sigma, interpolation order
  HDF5 field shape and uniform axes
  Equal sampled spans required by Grid
  .. Mode processing ..
  Near-zero frequency -> real mean
  Discard negative frequencies
  Sort positive modes by descending amplitude
  Normalize all fields by 2*pi*f0*B
  indx=0 selects the mean
  indx>0 selects an ordered mode
  .. Optional preprocessing ..
  Gaussian denoising
  Inclusive-grid resampling with zero-padded splines
}

class "3. GC2DH5Potential\nPotential subclass and runtime adapter" as H5Potential {
  .. Immutable state ..
  x and y axes, mean and complex modes
  frequencies and original field indices
  normalization, attributes, and source path
  .. Spatial representation ..
  One real/imag RectBivariateSpline pair per field
  Zero-padded boundaries and clipped coordinates
  Grid supplies periodic API and FFT metadata
  Public HDF5 interpolation remains non-periodic
  .. Field reconstruction ..
  Phi = Phi0 + 2 Re sum_j[C_j exp(+i f_j t)]
  .. Runtime API ..
  evaluate(...) and dynamic_part(...)
  electric_field(...) inherited from Potential
  Spatial derivatives and first time derivative
  gyroaverage(rho) returns GC2DH5Potential
}

class "4. GuidingCenterDynamics" as GCDynamics {
  .. Construction ..
  Accept a Potential instance and rho
  effective_potential = potential.gyroaverage(rho)
  FFT -> J0 Larmor filter -> inverse FFT
  Preserve HDF5 modes, frequencies, and metadata
  .. Physical capabilities ..
  vector_field = (-Phi_y, Phi_x)
  hamiltonian = Phi
  particle Jacobians from the spatial Hessian
  extended momentum derivative = -Phi_t
  .. Compatibility boundary ..
  Physical and reduced GC paths use this API directly
  Arbitrary HDF5 frequencies require general Phi_tt
  support in fully extended analytic R4/R8 methods
}

HDF5Source --> ImportPipeline
ImportPipeline --> H5Potential
H5Potential --> GCDynamics

@enduml
